        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Depending on their use case and available resources, we may refer them to an ISV partner who offers the solution, a consulting partner or a systems integrator who provides consulting and development services to build their solution, or our professional services team who can provide expert guidance on achieving their solution.",
