        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we offer competitive benefits packages to our full-time employees, subject to the satisfaction of certain eligibility requirements, that are aligned with industry standards and local market practices in each of the countries in which we operate.",
